<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 7.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 7.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Friday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- Mozambique will soon liberalise the importation of oil, ending the state oil company Petromoc's import monopoly, mineral and energy minister John Kachamila said.</p>
<p>- The 12-member Southern African Development Community will hold its first regional conference on fighting malaria in May, Mozambique's health minister Avertino Barreto said.</p>
